      "sourceTextSha256": "fb2641882841938ee7980ae49cc49ccc826ed495a5a6583e799c647eb880467d",
      "text": "After breakfast, we head to the  office where we will receive the entry permits already arranged beforehand, and we can also finalize payments and hand over vouchers if necessary. Once this is done, a minibus will take us to our logistics center in Puente de Inca. We will organize the loads, which will be transported by mules, and stay overnight there.\n\nTransport: Mendoza – Puente de Inca – Meals included: Breakfast and Dinner",
